Package: cudasparsr
Title: GPU-Aware Sparse Matrices for R
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an experimental sparse matrix abstraction for R with
    coordinate and compressed-row representations, conversion from 'Matrix'
    sparse matrices, sparse matrix-vector and sparse-dense multiplication, and
    row and column reductions. Uses an optional CUDA-enabled 'torch' backend
    for sparse multiplication and a portable 'Matrix' backend for testing.
